    response before any JS runs, for whatever page/sort this URL specifies
    (not just the default view). Removed by Alpine's init() the instant it
    boots — for a JS-capable browser this is purely a zero-flash first paint.

    Wrapped in the SAME flex layout (ahy-filter-layout + an empty
    ahy-filter-sidebar-width aside) the real Alpine grid below renders inside
